Generating explicit text is not difficult. It is essentially a number of formatted print statements (or XSLT33Extensible Stylesheet Language Transform
 transform clauses44One strategy for generating Explicit Text output is to generate GML and then use an XSLT transform to produce text.
) in the software generating the output. The difficult task is unambiguously reading the Explicit Text Formatted data back into a computer system. If a complex structure is described it will require pointers and delimiters to be able to identify the information elements. These pointers and delimiters eliminate the simplicity and are self-defeating. Their use must be minimized.

