The ​EndOfBlockMarker ​is ​the ​sequence ​of ​characters ​CR ​LF ​followed ​by ​CR ​LF ​ ​(or ​CR ​followed ​by ​CR ​ ​or ​LF ​followed ​by ​LF). ​This ​is ​equivalent ​to ​a ​blank ​record ​at ​the ​end ​of ​a ​block ​resulting ​in ​two ​EndOfRecordMarkers ​in ​a ​row.
EndOfBlockMarker
 ​ ​ ​ ​:​:= ​CHOICE ​{
 ​ ​ ​ ​ ​ ​ ​ ​CRLF_​CRLF_​Delimiter, ​ ​ ​ ​-​- ​(IA5 ​Codes ​13,10,13,10)
 ​ ​ ​ ​ ​ ​ ​ ​CR_​CR_​Delimiter, ​ ​ ​ ​-​- ​(IA5 ​Code ​13,13)
 ​ ​ ​ ​ ​ ​ ​ ​LF_​LF_​Delimiter, ​ ​ ​ ​-​- ​(IA5 ​Code ​10,10)
 ​ ​ ​ ​}
